338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 299 0 R
/E (Our research area looks at how academic campus events, like conferences, symposiums, design fests, and workshops, are organized and run behind the scenes. Most people think an event is just about putting up a poster and having attendees fill out a Google Form. In reality, a campus event is a chain reaction involving college authorities, teachers, student teams, invited guests, and attendees. We are studying what happens from the day an event is first planned to the day people actually walk into the hall.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
